      "name": "MTA Bus Automated Camera Enforced Routes: Beginning October 2019",
      "description": "This dataset provides information on the implementation dates of Automated Bus Lane Enforcement (ABLE) and Automated Camera Enforcement (ACE) systems across MTA bus routes. ABLE, launched as a pilot in 2019, and later expanded and rebranded as ACE in 2024, uses cameras mounted on buses to capture vehicles obstructing bus lanes, double parked, or parked illegally at bus stops.",
